        {
          "number": "836",
          "group": null,
          "text": "836. 化简：\na) $(3\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{3})\\cdot\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{60}$；\nb) $(\\sqrt{28}-2\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{7})\\cdot\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{84}$；\nc) $(\\sqrt{12}+2\\sqrt{18})\\cdot\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{2}-\\sqrt{96}$；\nd) $(4\\sqrt{3}-2\\sqrt{6}-1)2\\sqrt{3}$；\ne) $(\\sqrt{6}+\\sqrt{5})^2-\\sqrt{120}$；\nf) $(\\sqrt{14}-3\\sqrt{2})^2+6\\sqrt{28}$。",
          "lines": [
            "836. 化简：",
            "a) $(3\\sqrt{5}-2\\sqrt{3})\\cdot\\sqrt{5}+\\sqrt{60}$；",
            "b) $(\\sqrt{28}-2\\sqrt{3}+\\sqrt{7})\\cdot\\sqrt{7}+\\sqrt{84}$；",
