        {
          "number": "838",
          "group": null,
          "text": "838. 约分：\na) $\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+2}{\\sqrt{2}}$；\nb) $\\frac{5+\\sqrt{10}}{\\sqrt{10}}$；\nc) $\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}-3}{5\\sqrt{3}}$；\nd) $\\frac{a\\sqrt{b}+b\\sqrt{a}}{\\sqrt{ab}}$；\ne) $\\frac{x-\\sqrt{ax}}{a\\sqrt{x}}$；\nf) $\\frac{y+b\\sqrt{y}}{b\\sqrt{y}}$；\ng) $\\frac{2+\\sqrt{2}}{1+\\sqrt{2}}$；\nh) $\\frac{\\sqrt{15}-\\sqrt{5}}{1-\\sqrt{3}}$；\ni) $\\frac{2\\sqrt{3}-\\sqrt{6}}{\\sqrt{8}-2}$。",
          "lines": [
