        {
          "number": "839",
          "group": null,
          "text": "839. 化简：\na) $\\frac{x+\\sqrt{xy}}{\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{y}}$；\nb) $\\frac{x-\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x}-1}$；\nc) $\\frac{a+\\sqrt{6a}}{6+\\sqrt{6a}}$；\nd) $\\frac{p-2\\sqrt{p}}{2\\sqrt{p}-4}$；\ne) $\\frac{a-4}{\\sqrt{a}-2}$；\nf) $\\frac{b-9}{\\sqrt{b}+3}$。",
          "lines": [
            "839. 化简：",
            "a) $\\frac{x+\\sqrt{xy}}{\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{y}}$；",
            "b) $\\frac{x-\\sqrt{x}}{\\sqrt{x}-1}$；",
