          "figures": []
        },
        {
          "number": "842",
          "group": null,
          "text": "842. 证明下列各式的值是有理数：\na) $\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{2}-4}-\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{2}+4}$；\nb) $\\frac{1}{5+2\\sqrt{6}}+\\frac{1}{5-2\\sqrt{6}}$。",
          "lines": [
            "842. 证明下列各式的值是有理数：",
            "a) $\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{2}-4}-\\frac{1}{3\\sqrt{2}+4}$；",
            "b) $\\frac{1}{5+2\\sqrt{6}}+\\frac{1}{5-2\\sqrt{6}}$。"
          ],
