        },
        {
          "number": "843",
          "group": null,
          "text": "843. 化简下列各式再查表求它们的值：\na) $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3}}$；\nb) $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}+\\sqrt{7}}$；\nc) $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}-2}$；\nd) $\\frac{4}{3+\\sqrt{7}}$；\ne) $\\frac{1}{9-4\\sqrt{5}}$；\nf) $\\frac{1}{5\\sqrt{2}-7}$。",
          "lines": [
            "843. 化简下列各式再查表求它们的值：",
            "a) $\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{5}-\\sqrt{3}}$；",
            "b) $\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{10}+\\sqrt{7}}$；",
            "c) $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}-2}$；",
            "d) $\\frac{4}{3+\\sqrt{7}}$；",
            "e) $\\frac{1}{9-4\\sqrt{5}}$；",
            "f) $\\frac{1}{5\\sqrt{2}-7}$。"
